  "title": "Consolet Panel Nuts and Panels Update Coming Soon",
  "summary": "We are making the mounting of control and instrumentation devices even easier. The mild steel and stainless steel Consolets will soon be upgraded with welded nuts as a standard feature, speeding up installation and enhancing stability. In addition to this upgrade, we’re also introducing optional panels to support your applications.The Consolets will retain their existing catalog numbers. Panel catalog numbers align with the corresponding Consolet catalog number to ensure the correct size:",
